 {
  "key": "vand95",
  "verdict": "ambiguous",
  "identity": {
   "url": "https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1002/jts.2490080402.xml",
   "quote": "Dissociation and the fragmentary nature of traumatic memories: Overview and exploratory study",
   "why": "J Trauma Stress 8(4):505-525 (1995) is van der Kolk & Fisler, not a sole-author paper titled 'Trauma and memory'."
  },
  "fields": {},
  "notes": "Citation mixes two works. The venue/volume/issue/pages/year (J Trauma Stress 8(4):505-525, 1995) belong to B A van der Kolk and R Fisler, 'Dissociation and the fragmentary nature of traumatic memories: overview and exploratory study' (Crossref 10.1002/jts.2490080402; PubMed 8564271 lists DOI 10.1007/BF02102887; both registered). The title 'Trauma and memory' (sole author van der Kolk) is Psychiatry and Clinical Neurosciences 52(S1), 1998, DOI 10.1046/j.1440-1819.1998.0520s5S97.x (pages S97-S109 per DOI suffix, unconfirmed); there is also a 1996 book chapter of that title in Traumatic Stress (van der Kolk, McFarlane, Weisaeth, eds.). User must decide which work is meant: if the JTS paper, key becomes vandFisl95 (not in HEAD cdl.bib); if the 1998 paper, key vand98. Neither work is elsewhere in cdl.bib."
 },
